three.js 0.187.0 (MIT, see three-LICENSE.txt), bundled once into one classic script so a site works from disk
and in the meter (module scripts do not load from file://). Contents: everything exported by 'three', plus
RoomEnvironment and GLTFLoader from three/addons, on the global THREE.
